        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fermented juice</i> of other kinds, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος ἐκ κριθέων πεποιημένος</span> barley
			<i>wine,</i> a kind of <i>beer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.77
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶ. φοινικήϊος</span>
				palm<i>-wine,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				86
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.193
			</span></i> ; <i>lotus-wine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.177
			</span></i>, etc. ; from which drinks grape<i>-wine</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶ. ἀμπέλινος</span>) is expressly distd.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.60
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the wine-market,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρέχ᾽ ἐς τὸν οἶ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					299
				</span></i>
			. </div>
